    "identifier": "medical-release-medical-aura",
    "description": "<p>Life preserving Medical Chakra radiates from you in an aura with a 15-foot radius. Until this jutsu ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. Each non-hostile creature in the aura, (including you) has resistance to necrotic damage and becomes immune to the Bleeding condition.</p>\n<p>Additionally, a non-hostile, living creature regains 1 hit point when it starts its turn in the aura with 0 hit points. A creature can only regain hit points this way once per this jutsu’s casting.</p>",
